<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts mostly $.50</p>
<p>higher. Demand moderate to good on a light to moderate movement.</p>
<p>Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			   Country:			   Plants:</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 56.50-58.00 Few 58.50	  57.50-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs. 52.50-56.50</p>
<p>			   210-230 lbs. 47.50-52.50</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to .50 higher. Top 52.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 42.00-44.50</p>
<p>	  450-500 lbs. 44.50-46.50</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 47.50-51.00</p>
<p>Few over 600 lbs. 52.00</p>
